# {{name}}

Made with [Thistle](https://github.com/StacikM/thistle).

## Build & run

```bash
thistle build
thistle run
```

Don't have the `thistle` CLI on your PATH? Plain CMake works too:

```bash
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
```

## Version

This project's version lives in `thistle.json`, gets baked into `version.hpp` at build time, and is available in code as `GAME_VERSION` (see `src/main.cpp`). Change it with:

```bash
thistle version bump patch   # or minor / major
thistle version set 2.0.0
thistle version show
```

## Optional engine modules

Some engine features are big enough that they're off until a game asks for them:

```bash
thistle modules              # what there is, and what's on
thistle enable physics3d     # 3D rigid-body physics (Jolt): three::Physics3D
thistle disable physics3d
```

This edits `thistle.json`; the next `thistle build` picks it up.
